# The compiled frontend bundles ARE committed, deliberately.
#
# InvenTree's plugin installer only supports VCS URLs (git+https://...), which
# build from source - so a plugin installed through Settings -> Plugins from
# this repository would ship without any UI unless the bundles are in git.
#
# They are generated by `cd frontend && npm run build`. The CI 'bundles' job
# rebuilds them and fails if the result differs from what is committed, so
# never hand-edit anything in static/.
